title: Scripting in Lua
flow: A dozen lines of Lua add a palette command and a statusline chip; run the file from the palette and both appear at once.
# From tools/site-record/flows/lua.flow, without the recorder's
# `record` / `poster` marks; `reset` clears what the flow before left.
reset
copy assets/todos.lua todos.lua
open todos.lua
until "mnml.command"
wait 300
key ctrl+a
wait 500
# script.run_selection: the selected lines run in the script state
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 250
slowtype "lua: run the selected" 40
wait 500
key enter
wait 1000
key ctrl+p
wait 250
slowtype "main.zig" 50
key enter
until "fn main"
wait 1000
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 250
slowtype "count the todo and fixme" 35
wait 500
key enter
wait 1300
